[line]

[size=5][b]Requirements[/b][/size]
[list]
[*]Hardspace: Shipbreaker
[*][url=https://github.com/BepInEx/BepInEx/releases]BepInEx 5 (x64)[/url]
[*][b]ModdedShipLoader, our fork (v1.2.2-kb1):[/b] download [b]ModdedShipLoader.zip[/b] from this mod's Files tab, or from [url=https://github.com/KerballOne/Hardspace-Shipbreaker-PieMods/releases/tag/msl-v1.2.2-kb1]GitHub[/url]. These ships need it: with the original [url=https://github.com/piepieonline/Hardspace-Shipbreaker-PieMods/releases]ModdedShipLoader from PieMods[/url] the game runs out of memory while loading them on most PCs, and continuing a custom ship in Career after restarting the game breaks the ship.
[/list]

[size=5][b]Recommended mods[/b][/size]
[list]
[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/hardspaceshipbreaker/mods/42]TheExpanse[/url]: a companion mod for these ships. Heavy hull parts come free gently when cut, where the game would throw them, and the large interior takes a realistic time to pressurize and vent.
[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/hardspaceshipbreaker/mods/38]FreePlayPlus[/url]: saves in Free Play, so a ship this size does not have to be finished in one sitting.
[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/hardspaceshipbreaker/mods/44]Bigger Bays[/url]: a work bay that grows to fit the ship. The bay widens and lengthens as far as the ship needs, with a second furnace and processor on each side, so there is always one close to where you are cutting.
[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/hardspaceshipbreaker/mods/31]Mag Boots[/url]: lock onto a deck and walk it. The Tachi has twelve decks, stairs and a lot of floor, and it is far better on foot.
[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/hardspaceshipbreaker/mods/43]Themes[/url]: an MCRN shipyard would be in Mars orbit, not Earth's. This mod puts Mars in the sky outside the bay and plays your own music during a shift. Drop in The Expanse soundtrack.
[/list]

[size=5][b]Installation[/b][/size]
[list=1]
[*]Install BepInEx (link under Requirements).
[*]Download [b]ModdedShipLoader.zip[/b] from the Files tab and unzip it into the [b]Hardspace Shipbreaker[/b] game folder, the one that contains [b]BepInEx[/b]. It replaces any ModdedShipLoader already there.
[*]Download the Tachi from the Files tab and unzip it.
[*]Copy the [b]Tachi.KerballOne[/b] folder into:
[code]Hardspace Shipbreaker\BepInEx\plugins\ModdedShipLoader\Ships\[/code]
[*]Start the game and pick [b]MCRN Tachi[/b], [b]Rocinante[/b] or [b]Beratnas Gas Hauler[/b].
[/list]

To remove all three ships, delete the [b]Tachi.KerballOne[/b] folder.

[size=5][b]Performance and load time[/b][/size]
These are large ships, several times the size of most modded ships. The figures apply to each of the three.
[list]
[*][b]Load time:[/b] 45 seconds to about 2.5 minutes on a fast PC (8-core CPU, NVMe SSD). Expect longer on a hard disk or an older CPU.
[*][b]Memory:[/b] 32 GB of RAM is recommended. 16 GB works with our fork of ModdedShipLoader (under Requirements): with it the game uses about 8.5 GB with a ship loaded. It has not been tested on 8 GB and may fail to load.
[*]If the game closes during the loading screen, check that you have our fork of ModdedShipLoader (under Requirements), not the original.
[*]If the loading screen lasts more than ten minutes, the load has failed. Restart the game and try again.
[/list]

[size=5][b]Known limits[/b][/size]
[list]
[*]The ship is not at 1.0 yet. Expect rough edges, and please report what you find.
[*]Load times vary a lot between runs on the same machine.
[/list]
Questions, bugs, or feedback? Join the Shipbreaker Discord: [url=https://discord.gg/shipbreakergame]discord.gg/shipbreakergame[/url]

